  "#status": "The four members a pool grows only when something is wrong, and the reason the degraded specimen exists. They are OpenZFS's own catalogue entry for msgid ZFS-8000-9P \u2014 the same four strings on every machine in that condition, a verdict rather than a description of this estate \u2014 so they stay verbatim, which is also what lets a variant anchor the exact prose. The bound is stated because it is a decision and not a shape: were a future OpenZFS to interpolate a device or pool name into the prose, this classification would be wrong and the entry would have to move to the free-text pass.",
